1
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:18,143
That's where heaven will be.

2
00:00:19,019 --> 00:00:22,272
This location is Cape Canaveral.

3
00:00:22,355 --> 00:00:24,691
Kennedy Space Center.

4
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:31,531
Ermes!

5
00:00:32,574 --> 00:00:36,995
In the beginning of all matter,
there was gravity.

6
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:48,423
My right hand!

7
00:00:48,506 --> 00:00:52,051
Jolyne Cujoh!

8
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:56,306
So you are the one who's been
helping Jolyne this whole time.

9
00:01:03,271 --> 00:01:06,316
We have to stay away from his attacks!

10
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:10,195
Anything that touches its fist
turns inside out.

11
00:01:10,278 --> 00:01:15,033
I don't know its range,
but it makes everything fall sideways!

12
00:01:15,116 --> 00:01:18,661
So that's how the weak gravity
at Cape Canaveral

13
00:01:18,745 --> 00:01:21,164
affected and evolved the priest's Stand!

14
00:01:30,006 --> 00:01:34,677
To achieve happiness,
humans must bear a curse,

15
00:01:34,761 --> 00:01:35,887
and overcome fate.

16
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:41,851
The trial Dio and I had to overcome
was Joestar's bloodline.

17
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,830
Her heart was turned inside out.

18
00:02:12,132 --> 00:02:14,759
It's the phone!

19
00:02:15,343 --> 00:02:16,845
It didn't have a signal a moment ago.

20
00:02:18,555 --> 00:02:20,473
Could this be…

21
00:02:21,057 --> 00:02:22,350
Jolyne is alive.

22
00:02:23,017 --> 00:02:24,894
She's alive, but just barely.

23
00:02:25,478 --> 00:02:27,647
Mr. Jotaro!

24
00:02:27,730 --> 00:02:29,399
He's nearby!

25
00:02:29,482 --> 00:02:32,152
Anastasia, find Jolyne!

26
00:02:32,235 --> 00:02:34,696
Jolyne isn't dead!

27
00:02:34,779 --> 00:02:35,864
What?

28
00:02:35,947 --> 00:02:39,033
What did you do, Jolyne Cujoh?

29
00:02:39,117 --> 00:02:41,286
Your heart was turned inside out!

30
00:02:41,369 --> 00:02:43,371
We must settle the score.

31
00:02:43,454 --> 00:02:47,041
The Joestar bloodline must be overcome!

32
00:02:53,882 --> 00:02:55,466
Where are you going?

33
00:02:56,009 --> 00:03:00,513
The best way to protect Jolyne
is to kill that priest!

34
00:04:31,771 --> 00:04:34,607
EPISODE 35: SEE MOON (2)

35
00:04:34,691 --> 00:04:39,320
Jolyne… I sense she is
in no condition to move.

36
00:04:39,404 --> 00:04:40,989
How did she survive?

37
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:44,534
Could it be that I missed her vitals?

38
00:04:44,617 --> 00:04:45,451
No.

39
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:49,872
Without a doubt,
my Stand struck her heart.

40
00:04:49,956 --> 00:04:51,249
I was certain of it.

41
00:04:51,833 --> 00:04:55,253
Could it be Joestar's blood,

42
00:04:55,336 --> 00:04:56,921
the bloodline of Kujo?

43
00:04:57,005 --> 00:05:00,633
Is it getting in the way of Dio and me,
once again?

44
00:05:03,761 --> 00:05:08,474
I absolutely must finish off
Jolyne Cujoh here.

45
00:05:09,058 --> 00:05:13,604
Both in prison and in Orlando,
Jolyne Cujoh interfered.

46
00:05:13,688 --> 00:05:15,982
She's a trial that I must overcome
to achieve my purpose.

47
00:05:18,026 --> 00:05:21,404
Have confidence, Father Pucchi.

48
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:25,658
Fate will choose to side with me.

49
00:05:26,284 --> 00:05:30,997
Dio and I have a purpose much grander
than their pitiful sense of justice.

50
00:05:31,706 --> 00:05:36,794
Not a single human can hinder my plans!

51
00:05:40,089 --> 00:05:41,090
Hey you…

52
00:05:41,674 --> 00:05:44,135
Call a doctor.

53
00:05:44,218 --> 00:05:47,472
What happened to my hip bone?

54
00:05:49,098 --> 00:05:50,725
Help me!

55
00:05:50,808 --> 00:05:53,394
I'm close. I'm very close.

56
00:05:53,978 --> 00:05:56,314
Jolyne Cujoh fell near here.

57
00:06:08,993 --> 00:06:12,538
She's here.
That's a piece of Jolyne's clothing.

58
00:06:13,122 --> 00:06:15,958
Jolyne went inside this building.

59
00:06:17,585 --> 00:06:21,923
By the way, do not come
a single step closer to me.

60
00:06:25,843 --> 00:06:30,973
Stand back.
I don't even count you as an obstacle.

61
00:06:48,699 --> 00:06:49,659
Retreat, See Moon!

62
00:06:49,742 --> 00:06:51,661
That man is not Anastasia!

63
00:06:59,752 --> 00:07:03,756
Diver Drive can submerge in more places
than just the walls or the ground.

64
00:07:05,133 --> 00:07:08,594
I found a tourist who died
from your gravity ability,

65
00:07:08,678 --> 00:07:11,889
and changed his bone structure
to match mine.

66
00:07:12,932 --> 00:07:14,851
You're already within my range.

67
00:07:14,934 --> 00:07:18,729
Take this! Diver Drive!

68
00:07:19,313 --> 00:07:20,523
I missed!

69
00:07:21,107 --> 00:07:23,985
He turned his own face inside out.

70
00:07:26,529 --> 00:07:32,660
To me, you're merely a pesky fly
I can easily swat away.

71
00:07:57,268 --> 00:07:59,061
She touched my face.

72
00:07:59,979 --> 00:08:01,564
That was Jolyne Cujoh's hand.

73
00:08:02,148 --> 00:08:03,483
She's on the move.

74
00:08:03,983 --> 00:08:06,152
What is she planning to do?

75
00:08:06,235 --> 00:08:08,070
How is she able to move?

76
00:08:09,947 --> 00:08:11,616
That's blood.

77
00:08:11,699 --> 00:08:13,951
She is wounded, without a doubt.

78
00:08:14,535 --> 00:08:18,206
My heart tells me to track her down,
no matter what.

79
00:08:19,582 --> 00:08:22,418
I will end her, right here and now!

80
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:45,024
Jotaro Kujo will be here any minute
to rescue Jolyne Cujoh.

81
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:50,863
If Anastasia rejoins the fight,
the battle will be difficult.

82
00:08:52,990 --> 00:08:56,244
Jolyne Cujoh's allies are headed this way

83
00:08:56,327 --> 00:08:59,205
in hopes to save her life.

84
00:08:59,705 --> 00:09:01,207
Hence it is now,

85
00:09:01,290 --> 00:09:04,710
I must vanquish you, once and for all.

86
00:09:04,794 --> 00:09:06,295
Your death

87
00:09:06,379 --> 00:09:10,174
shall crush the resolve and hopes
of your allies who have gathered here.

88
00:09:13,844 --> 00:09:16,931
Especially Jotaro,
who will lose his daughter.

89
00:09:17,014 --> 00:09:20,977
His purpose and resolve in life
shall vanish along with Jolyne.

90
00:09:23,646 --> 00:09:26,524
He will no longer be a match
for Dio and me.

91
00:09:26,607 --> 00:09:29,777
I must finish her off, here and now!

92
00:09:30,486 --> 00:09:32,989
I will find you, no matter the cost!

93
00:09:46,043 --> 00:09:48,879
Come out, Jolyne Cujoh!

94
00:09:48,963 --> 00:09:50,715
Show yourself!

95
00:09:53,593 --> 00:09:55,011
Jolyne Cujoh!

96
00:09:59,015 --> 00:10:00,641
It's only her thread.

97
00:10:00,725 --> 00:10:02,643
Dammit, she's behind me!

98
00:10:07,982 --> 00:10:11,611
I will give it my all
to kill you right here!

99
00:10:12,111 --> 00:10:14,363
I know that you are wounded!

100
00:10:17,074 --> 00:10:20,953
I am the center of gravity,
so if I turn my body upside down,

101
00:10:21,037 --> 00:10:22,913
everything will fall toward my feet.

102
00:10:25,458 --> 00:10:26,584
See Moon!

103
00:10:30,046 --> 00:10:31,839
Both strikes landed!

104
00:10:31,922 --> 00:10:34,759
Both your arms are now useless!

105
00:10:56,947 --> 00:10:58,866
Those strange shapes…

106
00:10:59,367 --> 00:11:02,328
Why didn't her arms turn inside out?

107
00:11:04,121 --> 00:11:05,581
How could this be?

108
00:11:12,046 --> 00:11:14,256
Show yourself, Jolyne Cujoh!

109
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:17,343
You cannot run from your fate!

110
00:11:27,853 --> 00:11:29,688
What is that thing?

111
00:11:30,815 --> 00:11:31,941
What is that?

112
00:11:32,525 --> 00:11:35,152
What's the shape of that thing,
where her heart should be?

113
00:11:35,653 --> 00:11:37,613
Stone Ocean!

114
00:11:50,292 --> 00:11:52,461
Mobius strips?

115
00:11:53,170 --> 00:11:54,964
Is that what you're creating?

116
00:12:01,220 --> 00:12:02,930
STAND NAME: STONE OCEAN
STAND MASTER: JOLYNE CUJOH

117
00:12:04,265 --> 00:12:06,600
Start tracing its surface with a finger,

118
00:12:07,476 --> 00:12:09,061
and keep going.

119
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:14,150
Follow the surface
without lifting the finger.

120
00:12:14,233 --> 00:12:16,485
Before long, you have traced both sides.

121
00:12:17,278 --> 00:12:20,531
You will be back at your starting point.

122
00:12:21,907 --> 00:12:25,578
This non-orientable shape
was discovered in the 19th century

123
00:12:25,661 --> 00:12:27,663
by a German mathematician.

124
00:12:28,414 --> 00:12:31,834
It is called "Mobius strip,"
after his name.

125
00:12:32,835 --> 00:12:35,087
The back side exists
only if there is a front side.

126
00:12:35,588 --> 00:12:38,591
If there's no front and back,
there's no turning inside out.

127
00:12:41,302 --> 00:12:44,305
A non-orientable infinity strip

128
00:12:44,388 --> 00:12:46,182
can be made with thread!

129
00:12:47,099 --> 00:12:49,185
Is that what she created?

130
00:12:49,685 --> 00:12:53,606
Did she make a Mobius strip
the instant she was struck?

131
00:13:01,197 --> 00:13:04,909
I admire the first human
who tried to eat mushrooms.

132
00:13:05,784 --> 00:13:08,120
They risked poisoning themselves.

133
00:13:08,746 --> 00:13:14,084
Was he a fool who happened to get lucky?

134
00:13:22,384 --> 00:13:23,677
Otherwise,

135
00:13:24,428 --> 00:13:28,891
was the discovery driven
by his desperate starvation?

136
00:13:39,443 --> 00:13:45,449
Would you survive if I strike your head?

137
00:14:02,591 --> 00:14:03,968
A single hit will do.

138
00:14:04,051 --> 00:14:06,887
Which angle would be best?

139
00:14:06,971 --> 00:14:09,682
A single hit to the head is all it takes.

140
00:14:10,683 --> 00:14:12,226
Is this all you've got?

141
00:14:12,726 --> 00:14:14,061
I'm disappointed.

142
00:14:14,144 --> 00:14:16,772
Come at me with everything you got!

143
00:14:16,855 --> 00:14:17,773
No.

144
00:14:18,274 --> 00:14:20,568
I'm waiting for a definitive moment.

145
00:14:25,865 --> 00:14:31,161
I've been circling you, containing myself.

146
00:14:36,125 --> 00:14:39,545
I'm waiting for
the perfect moment to strike.

147
00:14:39,628 --> 00:14:41,839
Do you understand?

148
00:14:47,219 --> 00:14:50,055
The more I walk around,

149
00:14:50,139 --> 00:14:54,602
the more these objects fall.

150
00:14:54,685 --> 00:14:56,186
That's why I'm waiting.

151
00:14:57,104 --> 00:15:00,441
I'm waiting for victory
to fall into my hands.

152
00:15:02,401 --> 00:15:04,069
Do you understand?

153
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:07,406
Is your Mobius strip enough to save you,

154
00:15:07,489 --> 00:15:10,117
considering your wounds?

155
00:15:12,161 --> 00:15:14,705
There it is.
The chance I've been waiting for!

156
00:15:16,290 --> 00:15:18,250
A security officer's corpse!

157
00:15:18,834 --> 00:15:20,252
It's in my hand!

158
00:15:23,714 --> 00:15:24,548
Jolyne!

159
00:15:26,675 --> 00:15:29,053
- Shit!
- Whoa!

160
00:15:30,471 --> 00:15:31,847
Dammit.

161
00:15:36,685 --> 00:15:37,686
Jolyne!

162
00:15:37,770 --> 00:15:39,772
Jolyne!

163
00:15:59,291 --> 00:16:00,209
What?

164
00:16:07,841 --> 00:16:10,427
The Speedwagon Foundation

165
00:16:10,511 --> 00:16:14,139
shot this harpoon from the sky
three kilometers above.

166
00:16:14,223 --> 00:16:17,393
It was aimed to land
on the Visitor Center's premises.

167
00:16:19,436 --> 00:16:23,190
I made a copy of it with my sticker,
and duplicated the harpoon.

168
00:16:23,273 --> 00:16:27,319
When the sticker is removed,
the copy flies back to the original.

169
00:16:28,278 --> 00:16:31,240
I clung on to the harpoon,
so that despite your gravity,

170
00:16:31,323 --> 00:16:35,285
I can be pulled up here in an instant.

171
00:16:35,369 --> 00:16:38,455
Then, I used my Stand
to break it into pieces.

172
00:16:38,539 --> 00:16:42,501
We came to this spot
where he felt her presence.

173
00:16:47,047 --> 00:16:48,716
Dad…

174
00:16:51,385 --> 00:16:55,389
Jotaro Kujo and Ermes!

175
00:17:00,185 --> 00:17:02,771
You're surrounded, Father Pucchi.

176
00:17:03,814 --> 00:17:09,028
Completing your Stand in 36 hours
was just your wishful thinking.

177
00:17:09,528 --> 00:17:11,405
It's over.

178
00:17:11,488 --> 00:17:13,782
You have no allies left.

179
00:17:13,866 --> 00:17:16,243
You will be defeated before
the new moon arrives!

180
00:17:19,788 --> 00:17:22,291
You're mistaken, Emporio.

181
00:17:22,875 --> 00:17:24,877
As I thought, fate…

182
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:31,216
gives me trials, yet sides with me.

183
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:34,845
The ones who will aid me
in attaining my powers

184
00:17:34,928 --> 00:17:38,057
are the Joestar descendants!

185
00:17:38,682 --> 00:17:40,893
After being stuck under
this steel framing,

186
00:17:40,976 --> 00:17:42,811
I now understand!

187
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:46,065
My allies were the Kujos all along!

188
00:17:53,906 --> 00:17:58,118
What the hell?
He's rising up towards the sky!

189
00:17:58,202 --> 00:18:02,581
I am the center of gravity.

190
00:18:03,999 --> 00:18:06,293
I understand now, Dio!

191
00:18:06,376 --> 00:18:07,377
This is the answer.

192
00:18:07,461 --> 00:18:11,381
I have no need to wait another 36 hours
for the new moon to arrive.

193
00:18:11,965 --> 00:18:17,054
I need the gravitational force
of the new moon.

194
00:18:17,638 --> 00:18:19,348
Then I'll just float higher in the sky

195
00:18:19,431 --> 00:18:23,769
and find an area
with equal gravitational pull.

196
00:18:23,852 --> 00:18:27,981
I'll put myself where there is gravity
equal to that of the new moon!

197
00:18:28,065 --> 00:18:33,237
There must be an exact spot
that can complete See Moon's power!

198
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:34,947
You think we'll let you get away?

199
00:18:35,531 --> 00:18:38,283
You don't know when to surrender, do you?

200
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:41,328
Stay calm, look for the exact location.

201
00:18:41,411 --> 00:18:43,747
Count the prime numbers
and maintain my composure.

202
00:18:43,831 --> 00:18:48,710
- Thirteen, seventeen…
- That bastard is muttering something!

203
00:18:48,794 --> 00:18:50,754
Gravity hasn't changed!

204
00:18:50,838 --> 00:18:53,215
It's still pulling us sideways.

205
00:18:53,298 --> 00:18:55,467
Ermes, look to your right.

206
00:18:55,968 --> 00:18:57,803
Pick up the gun he dropped.

207
00:19:02,307 --> 00:19:05,185
You've grown, Jolyne.

208
00:19:17,865 --> 00:19:19,366
Hold onto the guardrails.

209
00:19:22,369 --> 00:19:23,453
Ermes,

210
00:19:23,537 --> 00:19:26,206
pick up the gun and shoot him.

211
00:19:31,253 --> 00:19:32,921
See Moon!

212
00:19:33,422 --> 00:19:35,799
Star Platinum: The World!

213
00:19:46,310 --> 00:19:51,064
You wish to use your Stand
to deflect the bullets.

214
00:19:51,648 --> 00:19:54,151
Time can stay stopped for
a maximum of five seconds.

215
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:59,239
You will not see this harpoon.

216
00:20:04,453 --> 00:20:06,455
Once the time starts again,

217
00:20:06,538 --> 00:20:08,457
the harpoon will impale you.

218
00:20:09,583 --> 00:20:11,084
Three seconds.

219
00:20:11,168 --> 00:20:12,336
Two seconds.

220
00:20:13,629 --> 00:20:14,504
One second.

221
00:20:16,423 --> 00:20:18,592
Time will now start.

222
00:20:28,977 --> 00:20:30,646
What just happened?

223
00:20:30,729 --> 00:20:32,731
The harpoon missed.

224
00:20:32,814 --> 00:20:34,441
He dodged during my time stop.

225
00:20:34,942 --> 00:20:36,276
That priest…

226
00:20:37,277 --> 00:20:38,487
He's unharmed.

227
00:20:40,489 --> 00:20:41,949
He's opening the hatch.

228
00:20:42,032 --> 00:20:44,660
It looks like he's trying to board it.

229
00:20:45,702 --> 00:20:48,372
The Space Shuttle is in the air!

230
00:20:50,540 --> 00:20:54,211
The priest is inside
the exhibition Shuttle!

231
00:20:56,046 --> 00:21:00,759
He dodged the harpoon, but how?

232
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:02,636
Damn…

233
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:05,555
he's not only trying to get away.

234
00:21:06,223 --> 00:21:08,392
Don't tell me…

235
00:21:09,017 --> 00:21:12,020
he learned something
that he shouldn't have,

236
00:21:12,521 --> 00:21:15,941
a condition that will allow him
to complete his Stand!

237
00:21:35,043 --> 00:21:38,630
It is you who brought
this Pucchi to heaven.

238
00:21:39,214 --> 00:21:43,218
All this time, even in prison,
my allies were you.

239
00:21:45,887 --> 00:21:48,265
Father in heaven,

240
00:21:48,348 --> 00:21:50,976
guide me!

241
00:21:51,059 --> 00:21:54,313
Watch over me,

242
00:21:54,396 --> 00:21:55,939
that I shall not stray from my path.

243
00:21:56,523 --> 00:22:00,235
I give myself to thee!

244
00:22:01,862 --> 00:22:03,113
Yes, I feel it!

245
00:22:12,372 --> 00:22:14,916
The position! It's here!

246
00:23:41,086 --> 00:23:46,091
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
